<BaseLayout title="Fuel System" description="Fuel pump, regulator, and line notes for LS Genesis Coupe swaps.">
  <h1>Fuel System</h1>
  <p>
    Most LS swaps need a higher-flow fuel pump and a return-style regulator if you are running a return system.
  </p>
  <p>
    The factory fuel pump can be used as a trigger for a dedicated relay on higher-power builds.
  </p>

